<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>Our Executives | EPR Access Limited</title>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="public-body">
  <%- include('../partials/public-nav') %>
  <main>
    <%- include('../partials/flash') %>

    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>MEET OUR EXECUTIVES</h1>
        <p>EPR Access Limited is led by a dynamic and experienced executive team, committed to driving business growth and delivering value to stakeholders.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-light">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="team-intro-text reveal">
          <p>Our leaders bring a wealth of expertise and innovation to their roles, guiding the company towards excellence in diverse sectors. With a focus on integrity, transparency, and accountability, they set the tone for a culture of performance and collaboration across the organization.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="team-grid">

          <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-photo">
              <img src="/images/team/Dr. Femi Adebayo .jpeg" alt="Dr. Femi Adebayo" />
            </div>
            <div class="team-info">
              <h3>Dr. Femi Adebayo</h3>
              <span class="team-role">Chief Executive Officer</span>
              <p>Leading EPR Access Limited with visionary leadership, driving business growth and delivering exceptional value to all stakeholders.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-photo">
              <img src="/images/team/TAIWO ADEBAYO .jpeg" alt="Taiwo Adebayo" />
            </div>
            <div class="team-info">
              <h3>Taiwo Adebayo</h3>
              <span class="team-role">Group Managing Director</span>
              <p>Overseeing the group's strategic direction with deep expertise in organisational management and operational excellence.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-photo">
              <img src="/images/team/KEHINDE ADEWOYIN.jpeg" alt="Kehinde Adewoyin" />
            </div>
            <div class="team-info">
              <h3>Kehinde Adewoyin</h3>
              <span class="team-role">Chief Investment Director</span>
              <p>Directing investment strategy across all asset classes, ensuring consistent returns aligned with client objectives.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-photo">
              <img src="/images/team/BABATUNDE FASUYI .jpeg" alt="Babatunde Fasuyi" />
            </div>
            <div class="team-info">
              <h3>Babatunde Fasuyi</h3>
              <span class="team-role">Corporate Adviser</span>
              <p>Providing strategic corporate advisory, guiding key business decisions and governance frameworks across the organisation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-photo">
              <img src="/images/team/GODWIN AIGBE.jpeg" alt="Godwin Aigbe" />
            </div>
            <div class="team-info">
              <h3>Godwin Aigbe</h3>
              <span class="team-role">Chief Operating Officer</span>
              <p>Ensuring seamless day-to-day operations, process efficiency, and outstanding service delivery across all business units.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-photo">
              <img src="/images/team/DR FESTUS OMORUSI.jpeg" alt="Dr. Festus Omorusi" />
            </div>
            <div class="team-info">
              <h3>Dr. Festus Omorusi</h3>
              <span class="team-role">Chief Investment Analyst</span>
              <p>Leading deep-dive investment analysis and research to identify high-value opportunities and manage portfolio risk.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-photo">
              <img src="/images/team/TOYIN OGUNMOLA.jpeg" alt="Toyin Ogunmola" />
            </div>
            <div class="team-info">
              <h3>Toyin Ogunmola</h3>
              <span class="team-role">Chief Financial Adviser</span>
              <p>Providing expert financial counsel, managing fiscal strategy and ensuring the financial integrity of all investment operations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
  <%- include('../partials/public-footer') %>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
